<style nonce="<%= content_security_policy_nonce %>">
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 70px 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.12), transparent 35%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 20%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.10), transparent 35%),
      #f7f7fb;
    font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
  }

  .legal-container {
    width: min(100%, 920px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    border: 1px solid rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.10);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 42px;
    box-shadow:
      0 20px 60px rgba(24, 18, 40, 0.08),
      0 4px 18px rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.05);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
  }

  .legal-header {
    padding-bottom: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeaf5;
  }

  .legal-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.09);
    color: #7008c8;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-title {
    margin: 0;
    color: #17131f;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 44px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.8px;
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: #777080;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-content {
    color: #45404c;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    margin: 34px 0 12px;
    color: #241c2d;
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .legal-content h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-content p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
    padding-left: 24px;
  }

  .legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    padding-left: 4px;
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: #7008c8;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .legal-contact {
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.07),
      rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.05)
    );
    border: 1px solid rgba(128, 9, 226, 0.10);
  }

  .legal-contact strong {
    color: #241c2d;
  }

  .legal-footer {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eeeaf5;
    color: #8b8492;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-page {
      padding: 35px 14px;
    }

    .legal-card {
      padding: 26px 20px;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .legal-title {
      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .legal-content {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .legal-content h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .legal-page {
      padding: 22px 10px;
    }

    .legal-card {
      padding: 22px 16px;
    }

    .legal-badge {
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .legal-title {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .legal-contact {
      padding: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>

<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy | A One GS Center" %>

<div class="legal-page">
  <div class="legal-container">
    <div class="legal-card">

      <div class="legal-header">
        <div class="legal-badge">
          🛡️ A One GS Center
        </div>

        <h1 class="legal-title">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>

        <p class="legal-subtitle">
          Your privacy and data protection are important to us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content">

        <p>
          <strong>A One GS Center</strong> respects your privacy and is committed
          to protecting the personal information of students, parents, teachers,
          and visitors who use our website.
        </p>

        <p>
          This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used,
          stored, and protected when you use
          <strong>https://aonegscenter.com</strong>.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
          Depending on how you use our website, we may collect information such as:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Name</li>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Mobile number</li>
          <li>Account login information</li>
          <li>Course and enrollment information</li>
          <li>Payment and transaction information</li>
          <li>Information submitted through contact or enquiry forms</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Payment information is processed through our payment service providers.
          We do not intentionally store complete card, UPI, or banking credentials
          on our own servers.
        </p>

        <h2>2. How We Use Information</h2>

        <p>Information may be used to:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Create and manage student accounts</li>
          <li>Provide courses and educational services</li>
          <li>Process enrollments and payments</li>
          <li>Send important account and payment notifications</li>
          <li>Respond to enquiries and support requests</li>
          <li>Improve website functionality and security</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. WhatsApp Communication</h2>

        <p>
          If you provide a mobile number and use services where WhatsApp
          communication is applicable, A One GS Center may use WhatsApp to send
          transactional or service-related notifications, such as payment
          confirmations and payment reminders.
        </p>

        <p>
          WhatsApp communication is provided through Meta's WhatsApp Business
          Platform.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Email Communication</h2>

        <p>
          We may send service-related emails regarding account activity,
          enrollment, payments, course information, and support requests.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Payments</h2>

        <p>
          Payments made through our website may be processed by third-party
          payment service providers. Payment processing is subject to the
          applicable provider's terms and privacy policies.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
          Our website may use third-party services for payment processing,
          communication, authentication, hosting, storage, analytics, or other
          technical functionality.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Data Security</h2>

        <p>
          We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect
          information from unauthorized access, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.
          However, no internet-based service can guarantee absolute security.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
          We may retain information for as long as necessary to provide our
          services, maintain account records, comply with legal obligations,
          resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Your Rights and Requests</h2>

        <p>
          You may contact us regarding access, correction, or deletion of personal
          information associated with your account, subject to applicable legal
          and operational requirements.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>

        <div class="legal-contact">
          <strong>A One GS Center</strong><br>
          Professor Colony, Gali No. 01,<br>
          Bara Chakia, East Champaran, Bihar

          <p style="margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0;">
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:supportaonegscenter@gmail.com">
              supportaonegscenter@gmail.com
            </a>
            <br>
            Mobile: 9117572747<br>
            WhatsApp: 9128907297
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-footer">
        <strong>Last updated:</strong> September 2026 · A One GS Center
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
